From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mackid1993 <david@brustein.net>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 21:15:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] DirecTV: opt-in DirecTV ad insertion (DAI)

Adds a per-source 'Use DirecTV ad insertion (DAI)' toggle. When on, playback uses DirecTV's Yospace ad-insertion stream (streamURL) instead of the fallback, with the same ad flags the DirecTV web client sends, filled from each account's own data (DMA, GPP consent -> is_lat, household/profile ids). Clears the playback cache when the toggle changes.

The logic lives in app/scrapers/directv_dai.py; upstream files only get one-line hooks.
